@startuml
title Boundaries — trust zones + VPC (board / LLM test)
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

' Mix of cloud / rectangle packages to exercise Cloud, Trust zone, and VPC boundary kinds.

cloud "Public internet / untrusted" as Public {
  rectangle "Chat widget" as Chat
  rectangle "Public docs site" as Docs
}

rectangle "Trust zone — DMZ" as DMZ {
  rectangle "API gateway" as GW
  rectangle "HITL console" as HITL
}

cloud "Private VPC (prod)" as VPC {
  rectangle "Support agent" as Agent
  database "Private CRM" as CRM
  rectangle "Refund tool" as Refund
}

Chat --> GW : HTTPS
Docs --> Agent : RAG crawl (cross-boundary)
GW --> Agent : authenticated
HITL --> Refund : approve
Agent --> CRM : read customer
Agent --> Refund : side-effect (no gate on this edge)

note right of DMZ
  Draw as Trust zone on the board.
  Contains: API gateway, HITL console
end note

note right of VPC
  Draw as VPC / network on the board.
  Contains: Support agent, Private CRM, Refund tool
end note

note left of Public
  Draw as Cloud (or Boundary).
  Contains: Chat widget, Public docs site
end note
@enduml
